        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(10) The existence of the sick leave bank and participation by a unit member in the bank does not negate or eliminate any other sick leave policies of the MCPS, nor does it in any way negate the rights of individual unit members who participate in the bank to other sick leave benefits.",
