        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(12) Unit members enrolling during the open period from July 1 through December 1 of any year will have a waiting period of six (6) months before the unit member can use the sick leave bank. New unit members joining the sick leave bank will also have a waiting period of six (6) months before the unit member can use the sick leave bank.",
